{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年42歲的洪永城（Tony）與38歲梁諾妍（Inez）結婚5年，育有大女「Sir Face」洪靖嵐及細女「Sir Nose」洪靖愉（Beryl），一家四口幸福滿溢。近日梁諾妍分享愛女上體操班的短片，見「佛妹」精靈活潑，展現驚人運動天賦，大曬軟骨功，旋即融化一眾網民。</p><figure><img alt=\"洪永城與梁諾妍於2021年結婚。（IG@inez_leong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189158625055084544697532.jpeg/GI2quSoZz7N1NHHeH70tBEUSeo3LstZv1OblMNTm5TA\"/><figcaption>洪永城與梁諾妍於2021年結婚。（IG@inez_leong）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"二人婚後育有大女洪靖嵐及細女洪靖愉（Beryl）。（IG@inez_leong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189158827199565824673948.jpeg/eEQwCUA9-jOC8Sk0jGxTghwt3z0qsrmAblYL825WC_M\"/><figcaption>二人婚後育有大女洪靖嵐及細女洪靖愉（Beryl）。（IG@inez_leong）</figcaption></figure><p>熱身拉筋大騷軟骨功</p><p>從梁諾妍上載的短片可見，紮起可愛孖辮、身穿粉紅色運動服的 Beryl 站在體操墊上，聽從外籍教練指導熱身時有板有眼。在練習拉筋環節，只見年紀小小、身軀圓碌碌的 Beryl 雙腿一開，便輕鬆自如地做出標準「一字馬」坐姿；更驚豔的是，她還能將上半身完全順暢前壓，整面腹部緊緊貼住地面，柔軟筋骨展現出驚人的「軟骨功」身手，連在場的外籍教練亦忍不住連連拍手讚好！</p><figure><img alt=\"Beryl認真做熱身。（IG@inez_leong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189164381326282752320467.jpeg/c1YEHQeLZmAFMo3WPAh8atmKKpzI5h8jbUsbJm1LGyY\"/><figcaption>Beryl認真做熱身。（IG@inez_leong）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大騷一字馬。（IG@inez_leong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189164623140491264068941.jpeg/ZVLaAmaHd4n4BhLutX_A2u4C0KQ8iwnwedkw_nnZMP4\"/><figcaption>大騷一字馬。（IG@inez_leong）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"曬驚人柔軟度。（IG@inez_leong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189164782310133760475396.jpeg/Tv50jn2YIlpcWNFt49HBBrXVcxladKTXqe781Knu_NQ\"/><figcaption>曬驚人柔軟度。（IG@inez_leong）</figcaption></figure><p>展現超齡臂力與肢體協調度</p><p>除了地面動作展現超強柔韌性，Beryl在單槓練習時的表現更令人忍俊不禁。在教練的輔助下，毫不怯場的Beryl先用自己圓滾滾的招牌小肚腩精準「頂住」單槓，隨即順勢借力俐落翻身，整套動作一氣呵成，展現出遠超兩歲半幼兒的肢體協調度與驚人臂力。隨後她更跟隨輕快音樂節奏自在搖擺、練習彈跳與平衡，全程掛著招牌燦爛笑容，十分陶醉於體操的樂趣中。</p><figure><img alt=\"整套動作一氣呵成。（IG@inez_leong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189164918679539712364871.jpeg/GZ6jW9FRxbcRyllD9dupDx0pPkMFMPkDvMOF_7zDhf8\"/><figcaption>整套動作一氣呵成。（IG@inez_leong）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"盡得媽媽運動基因。（IG@inez_leong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189165225027309568149780.jpeg/DAfC2H7D4jT2Q3Fl_y7STmAQKTAGuRY1vDWpo7w1qaM\"/><figcaption>盡得媽媽運動基因。（IG@inez_leong）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Beryl全程掛著招牌燦爛笑容。（IG@inez_leong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189171330444955648206859.jpeg/g9dWm1_RrottcwtpuH1nq6yWo4Kj0-CA-b4KhPm-CoQ\"/><figcaption>Beryl全程掛著招牌燦爛笑容。（IG@inez_leong）</figcaption></figure><p>全職教練媽媽發文激讚</p><p>看見愛女身手矯健，身為全職健身教練的媽媽梁諾妍亦忍不住發文笑言：「徇眾要求！體操妹太可愛，出個Post俾佛妹粉治癒下。佛妹用個肚腩仔頂住支Bar真係好醒目，小朋友做體操實在太可愛！」短片一出隨即俘虜大批網民芳心，紛紛留言大讚Beryl完美遺傳了媽媽身為運動員的優良DNA，兼具萌態與身手，絕對是潛力無限的「體操界未來之星」！</p><figure><img alt=\"Beryl陶醉於體操的樂趣中。（IG@inez_leong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189165050665897984695384.jpeg/t9rKxnrtg3WgV6vA_iYAiV0hXCuCiD1X35jesN-Y3rA\"/><figcaption>Beryl陶醉於體操的樂趣中。（IG@inez_leong）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁諾妍十分熱愛運動。（IG@inez_leong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189165902520651776528391.jpeg/zWG5lxSiOCFzYWUsM2AvIbL56-MyB677RsU7HkbFOx4\"/><figcaption>梁諾妍十分熱愛運動。（IG@inez_leong）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:04.550109+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":960,"images":10,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:57.122287+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:57.122287+00:00","content_hash":"62866659b62df3aa0a332ff1ca585a8c09cc48cf80cfb0d811fa987770ecb103","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}